<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.3 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.3 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    27  days     900 million pesos  28.80 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     900 million pesos  26.93 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     900 million pesos  24.29 pct</p>
<p>    357 days     600 million pesos  21.35 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 800 million pesos worth of 728-day Bondes, and 200 UDIs worth of 1,022-day UDI bonds.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
